<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>International news from the Americas - France 24</title><subtitle type="html">FRANCE 24’s coverage of the political, social and economic issues in the United States, Canada, Mexico, Argentina, Brazil and across the Americas.</subtitle><id>https://www.france24.com/en/americas/rss</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:50:04Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/rss" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>Haiti PM praises Bukele after Salvadoran troops help destroy gang headquarters</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:50b05613c0a64c0e8054717eaab7c48b32d37a497212309b8bd2c4acfa496723</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:48:58Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T01:41:43Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20261111-haiti-pm-bukele-salvadoran-troops-gang-headquarters--87db38cfc001.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261111-haiti-pm-bukele-salvadoran-troops-gang-headquarters" /><summary type="html">Haitian Prime Minister Alix Didier Fils-Aime praised Salvadoran President Nayib Bukele on Tuesday after Salvadoran troops destroyed a suspected gang leader’s home. Bukele’s deployment of more than 2,000 soldiers following four Salvadoran troops’ disappearance has raised concerns over rules of engagement and coordination with a UN-backed force combating Haiti’s gangs.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>Trump ally Jim Jordan elected House Republican leader after midterm defeat</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c0504489f6a131d517984753eeef1930c0919cff6903149f58ae1612c8ace9cd</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:49:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T22:42:42Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20261110-trump-jim-jordan-elected-house-republican-leader-midterm-defeat--88636c0967f2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261110-trump-jim-jordan-elected-house-republican-leader-midterm-defeat" /><summary type="html">Congressman Jim Jordan, a hardline ally of President Donald Trump, was elected House Republican leader on Tuesday, defeating Steve Scalise 106-73 in a secret ballot, US media reported. He replaces Mike Johnson after Republicans lost both chambers of Congress in last week’s midterm elections and will lead the party’s opposition.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>US charges three 'Iranian operatives' over RAF Fairford terror plot</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e441b3b60a4a643b077a40278eb3f1b4026d713c972eb3f235543240ef802a7f</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:49:07Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T22:26:36Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20261110-us-iranian-operatives-raf-fairford-terror-plot--9a51eaf4803f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261110-us-iranian-operatives-raf-fairford-terror-plot" /><summary type="html">The US Justice Department on Tuesday charged three men it described as Iranian operatives over an alleged September terrorist plot at Britain's RAF Fairford airbase in England. Prosecutors said one suspect directed individuals to drive vans, some carrying fuel barrels, to the base, which housed US military aircraft and personnel.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>Filming amongst body bags: New Colombian president’s comms campaign sparks backlash</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:51aef1d26a4ffe724ba735048443995f2daa05a90202b6ceee07d90a803b8e7b</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:49:34Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T18:18:30Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20261110-filming-amongst-body-bags-new-colombian-president-s-comms-campaign-sparks-backlash--bafca6701193.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261110-filming-amongst-body-bags-new-colombian-president-s-comms-campaign-sparks-backlash" /><summary type="html">Since taking office in August, new far-right Colombian president Abelardo de la Espriella has shared video after video promoting his security forces – especially operations they’ve carried out against armed groups. In some, De la Espriella speaks standing among body bags. Others feature prisoners or look like they were taken from an action film. However, there’s been growing outcry about his social media glorification of repressive policies.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>US Pentagon chief Pete Hegseth calls impeachment moves 'a farce'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4c59b49cb3afc1ddfca96f781cbdad59be4df97ecd8b81440f75df61014189b0</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:49:46Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T16:43:39Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261110-us-pentagon-chief-pete-hegseth-calls-impeachment-moves-a-farce--ba02721d785d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261110-us-pentagon-chief-pete-hegseth-calls-impeachment-moves-a-farce" /><summary type="html">US Defence Secretary Pete Hegseth on Tuesday, November 10, called an effort to impeach him over ​abuse of power in the Iran war a farce and sabotage that plays into the hands of adversaries. FRANCE 24's International Affairs Commentator Douglas Herbert has more.</summary></entry><entry><title>Who exactly is Pete Hegseth, the Pentagon chief facing an impeachment bid?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:95d9acef08d69cb803528bc0662cc3c1dfc35849ce1f462deff44115dce423bf</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:49:49Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T16:41:45Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261110-who-exactly-is-pete-hegseth-the-pentagon-chief-facing-an-impeachment-bid--a63efa5a2f0e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261110-who-exactly-is-pete-hegseth-the-pentagon-chief-facing-an-impeachment-bid" /><summary type="html">US Defence Secretary Pete Hegseth on Tuesday dismissed the impeachment effort against him as "a political spectacle". He made the comments a day after Republican Thomas Massie launched a bid to impeach him over his handling of the unpopular war in Iran and other actions. But who is Pete Hegseth? A former Fox News host and military veteran, he has become one of the most prominent figures in the Trump administration.</summary></entry><entry><title>Pope Leo XIV visits Argentina in second leg of Latin American tour</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7065f11f93284e4d545e99607e1de04981be26e375b64cb3cb44898a2e2e3bff</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:49:55Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T16:38:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261110-pope-leo-xiv-visits-argentina-in-second-leg-of-latin-american-tour--5699f80f5201.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261110-pope-leo-xiv-visits-argentina-in-second-leg-of-latin-american-tour" /><summary type="html">Pope Leo XIV visited Argentina on the second leg of his South American tour, following a stop in Uruguay. During his visit, he celebrated public Masses, met with the faithful and held talks with religious and government leaders. Peru is the final stop on the pontiff's tour.</summary></entry><entry><title>REPLAY: Pentagon chief Hegseth holds news briefing amid impeachment push</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9af9d998a178396dc44302bf6c8d5f446f5286216f2a5876a42534a3a0279c1a</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:48:00Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T16:23:38Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261110-replay-pentagon-chief-hegseth-holds-news-briefing-amid-impeachment-push--d6c88fc759f8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261110-replay-pentagon-chief-hegseth-holds-news-briefing-amid-impeachment-push" /><summary type="html">US ​Defence Secretary Pete Hegseth on Tuesday called ​moves to impeach him over abuse of power in the Iran war a "farce" that ​would ‌fail. Hegseth made the comment ⁠at a news conference – his first since May – a day after US Representative ‌Thomas Massie, a Kentucky Republican, introduced eight ⁠articles of impeachment against him. Watch our replay.</summary></entry><entry><title>House Republicans block Hegseth impeachment bid, handing Trump a win</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0798a62156158f8e39a11f783ff288b1b9e9a2ef44b4e7828d9709357a148021</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:50:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T13:32:48Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20261110-live-pentagon-chief-pete-hegseth-calls-move-to-impeach-him-a-farce--37c23c16e6de.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261110-live-pentagon-chief-pete-hegseth-calls-move-to-impeach-him-a-farce" /><summary type="html">Republicans in the US House on Tuesday blocked an effort to impeach Defense Secretary Pete Hegseth over the Iran war, handing President Donald Trump a victory days after his party’s midterm defeat. Hegseth dismissed the move as a “farce” and “political spectacle”, while Trump praised his performance as “A plus”.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>California voters reject measure to tax the wealth of billionaires</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d224667099c3c0a7e578ddcd4c766817e4e15ceb63f1a36e647110c186feba0b</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:48:00Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T11:20:09Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261110-california-voters-reject-measure-to-tax-the-wealth-of-billionaires--c30b5a0e4d33.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261110-california-voters-reject-measure-to-tax-the-wealth-of-billionaires" /><summary type="html">California voters have rejected a first-in-the-nation tax on the net worth of billionaires following a contentious ballot fight that generated huge spending by some prominent tech leaders eager to stop their taxes from going up. The measure would have imposed a one-time 5% tax on the wealth of Californians whose net worth exceeds $1 billion. FRANCE 24's correspondent in Los Angeles Loic Pialat has more.</summary></entry><entry><title>Paraguayan protesters are back on the streets despite the removal of President</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5a250f691c8181e115c7346729d4977253a83de5588e17e29deb56127514c60c</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:48:00Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T10:53:38Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261110-paraguayan-protesters-are-back-on-the-streets-despite-the-removal-of-president--9d1f87be900c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261110-paraguayan-protesters-are-back-on-the-streets-despite-the-removal-of-president" /><summary type="html">A banking crisis that saw the president of Paraguay impeached Friday, November 6, continues to rock the country with protesters back on the streets. The Ueno Bank started as a digital first bank, attracting many low income customers, quickly growing to become a major bank in charge of state pensions and holding the accounts of several government institutions before having its accounts frozen by the central bank due to solvency concerns.</summary></entry><entry><title>Peru gets ready to welcome Pope Leo XIV on his South America tour</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:312e7894502978a8916faccb2d7b1c9bec809e21ebe8321b6ddc7c1e0f685986</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:48:00Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T10:48:57Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261110-peru-gets-ready-to-welcome-pope-leo-xiv-on-his-south-america-tour--8a71beaecfda.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261110-peru-gets-ready-to-welcome-pope-leo-xiv-on-his-south-america-tour" /><summary type="html">Pope Leo XIV continued his South American tour on Wednesday, November 11, with a visit to Peru, after stops in Uruguay and Argentina. The American-born pontiff lived in Peru for several years and even became a Peruvian citizen. Ahead of his arrival, the country unveiled a giant statue in his honour.</summary></entry><entry><title>US Republican Thomas Massie launches bid to impeach Pete Hegseth</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:60d252e58d722a54348af5a4c0d1e4293aacb9c9ae9c2a184f607a0d42e01af8</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:48:00Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T10:42:42Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261110-us-republican-thomas-massie-launches-bid-to-impeach-pete-hegseth--b093e97a7254.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261110-us-republican-thomas-massie-launches-bid-to-impeach-pete-hegseth" /><summary type="html">US Republican Thomas Massie moved Monday, November 9, to force a vote to impeach Defence Secretary Pete Hegseth, pressing his fellow Republicans to remove one of the Trump administration's most prominent figures following sweeping election losses blamed in part on fallout from the war in Iran. FRANCE 24's correspondent in Washington Fraser Jackson has more.</summary></entry><entry><title>California voters reject proposed one-time tax on billionaires' wealth</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:66aa2fe258cbd970f0aefb6faa8b3f3be68dc908cd24a6f8828fdafc3ff12731</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:48:00Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T03:19:56Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20261110-california-voters-reject-proposed-one-time-tax-on-billionaires-wealth--23d9a4920bc9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261110-california-voters-reject-proposed-one-time-tax-on-billionaires-wealth" /><summary type="html">California voters have rejected a proposed 5% tax on the net worth of billionaires, handing a victory to tech leaders who poured hundreds of millions of dollars into defeating the measure. The defeat of Proposition 40 also marks a setback for progressives seeking to tax the wealth of the ultra-rich.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>Amnesty urges El Salvador to disclose terms of Haiti troop deployment</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2137c080679eb00dbf46c263e8d89f2ec61d88e3f4030eccd268779a663a8ff6</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:48:00Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T02:24:22Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20261110-amnesty-urges-el-salvador-to-disclose-terms-of-haiti-troop-deployment--f3928145d38d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261110-amnesty-urges-el-salvador-to-disclose-terms-of-haiti-troop-deployment" /><summary type="html">Amnesty International has called on El Salvador and Haiti to make public the agreement governing the deployment of around 2,000 Salvadoran troops to the gang-plagued Caribbean nation, warning of risks to human rights and accountability.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>US Defense Secretary Hegseth faces expected impeachment vote this week</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a3fbccb7e94695a933aa272734252d9f00ad3a1cd24c29215cb4c601a3985fa2</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:48:00Z</updated><published>2026-11-09T22:51:39Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/us-defense-secretary-hegseth-faces-expected-impeachment-vote-this-week--f8706db36377.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/us-defense-secretary-hegseth-faces-expected-impeachment-vote-this-week" /><summary type="html">A Republican lawmaker moved Monday to impeach US Defense Secretary Pete Hegseth over the war in Iran, setting up a potentially explosive vote in Congress days after President Donald Trump's party suffered a crushing midterm defeat. Kentucky congressman Thomas Massie introduced eight articles of impeachment accusing Hegseth of illegally waging war without congressional authorization and abusing his powers as Pentagon chief. FRANCE 24's Fraser Jackson reports from Washington.</summary></entry><entry><title>Trump says he was 'kidding' about Dana White press secretary job, amid online mix-up claims</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e901f9d5733413f199158f3241d93620d49d2dcfc3421d93902a95da2c60b2e8</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:48:00Z</updated><published>2026-11-09T20:51:32Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/truth-or-fake/20261109-trump-says-he-was-kidding-about-dana-white-press-secretary-job-amid-online-mix-up-claims--6373b90e4085.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/truth-or-fake/20261109-trump-says-he-was-kidding-about-dana-white-press-secretary-job-amid-online-mix-up-claims" /><summary type="html">Donald Trump says he was "only kidding" when he announced he had offered his friend and UFC boss Dana White the job of White House press secretary. The US president shared an AI-generated video of White behind the briefing room podium and UFC fighters attacking journalists. But the announcement also sparked online speculation that Trump may have confused the UFC executive with a former Pentagon spokesperson, also called Dana White. There's no evidence of a mix-up, as Vedika Bahl explains.</summary><category term="Truth or Fake" /></entry><entry><title>Republican congressman launches impeachment bid against Pentagon chief Hegseth</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4364023660c9212f3fe6d53ca8caa7573b729e2df07beffc09745ba2ec0c841f</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:48:00Z</updated><published>2026-11-09T19:32:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20261109-republican-congressman-launches-impeachment-bid-against-pentagon-chief-hegseth--505cf51d6d47.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261109-republican-congressman-launches-impeachment-bid-against-pentagon-chief-hegseth" /><summary type="html">Kentucky congressman Thomas Massie moved on Monday to force a vote in the House of Representatives to impeach Defence Secretary Pete Hegseth, putting pressure on his fellow Republicans to decide whether to remove one of the Trump administration’s most prominent figures following the party's crushing defeat in midterm elections.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>Nvidia shares tumble after spy probe announced</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:caa67442dc1dca84ebaec28d465f9c159b724c46faff918baad6117a56b8e706</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:48:00Z</updated><published>2026-11-09T16:47:19Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261109-nvidia-shares-tumble-after-spy-probe-announced--b82780c21853.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261109-nvidia-shares-tumble-after-spy-probe-announced" /><summary type="html">Shares of artificial intelligence leader Nvidia tumbled early Monday after the chip company said it launched an investigation of CEO Jensen Huang following reports he was targeted by Chinese intelligence. Nvidia shares were down more than eight percent in opening trading after its board announced that a committee of independent directors assisted by outside counsel would undertake the probe.</summary></entry><entry><title>Nvidia CEO probed over alleged China spy: Who exactly is Jensen Huang?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d4718a0c5d375e686301bd1464b77f70300212cc24c77dacd59249f60ae5d425</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:48:00Z</updated><published>2026-11-09T15:26:10Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261109-nvidia-ceo-probed-over-alleged-china-spy-who-exactly-is-jensen-huang--d5c28f6e3627.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261109-nvidia-ceo-probed-over-alleged-china-spy-who-exactly-is-jensen-huang" /><summary type="html">AI chip behemoth Nvidia was plunged into turmoil Monday, November 9, after its high-profile CEO Jensen Huang acknowledged having an affair, with reports saying US officials believe the woman was spying for China. But who exactly is Jensen Huang, and why does this case matter so much?</summary></entry><entry><title>AI, affair and espionage: Why is Nvidia's chief Jensen Huang under scrutiny?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:db67123b5c568d1bdf39fc3feb4c8261c5be7aec53ba722019c8057f495a844d</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:48:00Z</updated><published>2026-11-09T11:45:31Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261109-ai-affair-and-espionage-why-is-nvidia-s-chief-jensen-huang-under-scrutiny--001bc358f99a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261109-ai-affair-and-espionage-why-is-nvidia-s-chief-jensen-huang-under-scrutiny" /><summary type="html">Nvidia chief and tech titan Jensen Huang was in the spotlight on Monday after acknowledging an affair with a woman US officials say was working for Chinese intelligence, a claim Beijing denied.</summary></entry><entry><title>Trump says deportation crackdown was 'too tough' after midterm setback</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:706ba6c201590e06f5b0ad3884d63f15927643bd4dab1487e860ef54be94a95f</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:48:00Z</updated><published>2026-11-09T08:02:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20261109-trump-says-deportation-crackdown-was-too-tough-after-midterm-setback--0e7c615eb46f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261109-trump-says-deportation-crackdown-was-too-tough-after-midterm-setback" /><summary type="html">US President Donald Trump said his administration's mass deportation campaign may have been "too tough" in a television interview aired Sunday, days after Republicans suffered heavy losses in midterm elections.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>Trump vows comeback as parties clash over Democrat prosecution threats</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d7a0afa77c55ad29cdfaa1c6b37e9c15daccec78a06f4b31da5a190f05fca08e</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:48:00Z</updated><published>2026-11-09T01:13:10Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20261109-trump-comeback-democrats-prosecution-threats--3ddd0d742c90.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261109-trump-comeback-democrats-prosecution-threats" /><summary type="html">President Donald Trump vowed a political comeback on Sunday after Republicans lost control of Congress in last Tuesday’s midterms, as incoming Democratic leaders pledged to hold his administration to account, and the attorney general promised to defend officials against threatened prosecutions.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>Nvidia shares tumble as CEO faces probe over affair with alleged Chinese spy</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:85744ab3e85390bf45641dc9dd9bbb45498ccbe0cc66b9fc11f4218385c4c0d8</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:48:00Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T22:47:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20261108-nvidia-shares-slide-as-board-probes-ceo-over-china-spy-reports--1815cffaf154.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261108-nvidia-shares-slide-as-board-probes-ceo-over-china-spy-reports" /><summary type="html">Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang is facing scrutiny after reports he was targeted in a suspected Chinese intelligence operation involving a businesswoman with whom he was having an affair. The controversy has rattled investors, sending Nvidia shares tumbling.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>Pope Leo criticises Milei’s austerity in Argentina, says growth must benefit all</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:47cb1ad6d40bf6b2a2119b988f616ff699863a44cf6ded6a00dd4e0020bf705c</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:48:00Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T22:23:19Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20261108-pope-leo-argentina-visit-milei--0e21f75a1391.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261108-pope-leo-argentina-visit-milei" /><summary type="html">Pope Leo XIV arrived in Argentina on Sunday from Uruguay, where his Latin America tour began, facing calls to help bridge divisions after three years of austerity under President Javier Milei. The visit to Buenos Aires is the first by a pontiff to the late Pope Francis’s homeland in nearly four decades.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>Pope Leo in Latin America: Papal politics and Peru</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:236402b180cd074b78eeb4dbae7e4e1eeecc1280d1c7d1fc16aa556eeecc6de8</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:48:00Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T21:16:48Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/spotlight/20261108-pope-leo-in-latin-america-papal-politics-and-peru--dde1c7121fce.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/spotlight/20261108-pope-leo-in-latin-america-papal-politics-and-peru" /><summary type="html">After wrapping up his first visit to Uruguay, Pope Leo XIV heads to Argentina for the second leg of his South America tour, where he's expected to draw the biggest turnout of his papacy so far. Colleen Dulle, Vatican Correspondent at America Magazine and co-host of the "Inside the Vatican" podcast, joins us to analyse the significance of Leo's Latin American tour.</summary><category term="Spotlight" /></entry><entry><title>Pope Leo urges men to respect wives amid Latin American femicide crisis</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7808e525b9cedc9e72af17fd4f7674df76ab7967b546ace520f72d0f96f16059</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:48:00Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T14:15:54Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20261108-pope-leo-urges-husbands-to-respect-wives-amid-femicide-crisis-across-latin-america--c0353931a5d5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261108-pope-leo-urges-husbands-to-respect-wives-amid-femicide-crisis-across-latin-america" /><summary type="html">Pope Leo XIV urged men to respect their wives as he wrapped up the first leg of his 12-day tour of Latin America. The region recorded nearly 20,000 instances of women being killed over the past five years alone, most of them murdered by a current or former partner.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>Paraguay: Senate impeached Peña rather than accept his offer to resign</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:43a1d3175378d70b725efdd2427c7a0e5e4d6a295e5c24c975576c86d0ce19b2</id><updated>2026-11-11T06:48:00Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T10:42:59Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261108-paraguay-senate-impeached-pe_a-rather-than-accept-his-offer-to-resign--268a291e27fe.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261108-paraguay-senate-impeached-pe%C3%B1a-rather-than-accept-his-offer-to-resign" /><summary type="html">Paraguay's ousted president, Santiago Peña, has been charged over the collapse of Ueno Bank. Initially placed under house arrest, he has since been transferred to a military facility for his own safety. Nearly three million customers were locked out of their accounts after regulators seized control of the online bank. Repayments are now under way, but protests continue as customers demand access to 